OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F163A1789657118
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Fri 2 Oct to Fri 16 Oct
OL,6,FChangeable and perhaps unsettled
OL,7,Fweather may become more frequent as we
OL,8,Fmove into October, with periods of
OL,9,Frain and stronger winds becoming more
OL,10,Flikely to spread from the west,
OL,11,Falthough with some transient drier and
OL,12,Fbrighter spells also. As is not
OL,13,Funtypical as we move towards mid-
OL,14,FOctober, deeper low pressure systems
OL,15,Fcould bring occasional periods of very
OL,16,Fstrong winds. Temperatures are likely
OL,17,Fto remain above normal overall, though
OL,18,Fbrief cooler interludes are also
OL,19,Fpossible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
